# Dockerfile-local ignore file.
#
# Docker prefers `<path-to-Dockerfile>.dockerignore` over the context root's
# `.dockerignore`, and that is exactly what is wanted here: the root file
# excludes `tests/`, which is DROPPED for the server image but REQUIRED for
# this one -- the probe boots the TUI against the app double the test suite
# owns (`tests/unit/tui/test_app_pilot.py`), so a context without `tests/`
# cannot run the one probe that matters most on a new OS.
#
# Everything below is build weight or host contamination, never source.
.git
.github
.venv
.worktrees
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.egg-info
*.pyc
.pytest_cache
.mypy_cache
.ruff_cache
node_modules
bench
benchmarks
docs/evidence
static
extension
local_operator/mobile/web/node_modules
